      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am trying to narrow down the availability of this JNI workaround as this is not the good practice that general use cases should follow (from my understanding). And I don\u0027t want any code outside of the thread/ to access the ot-daemon binder service with `waitForService(\"ot_daemon\")`.\n\nI need to write JNI code in the Thread system service anyway (for creating the tun interface), so no additional JNI library is added here.",
